agent-name-assurance-explained

This product includes concepts, control IDs, and file references from
agent-name-assurance-baseline (ANAB), version 0.10.0. The author is
Sankarshan Mukhopadhyay (https://github.com/sankarshanmukhopadhyay).
Source: https://github.com/sankarshanmukhopadhyay/agent-name-assurance-baseline
That work is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The source repository has no NOTICE file.

This repository is an independent plain-language guide. It is not an
official part of the source project.

Changes from the source:
- The main concepts are written again in Simplified Technical English.
- The three diagrams in assets/ are new.
- SKILL.md is a new agent skill (Agent Skills format) that applies the baseline to one agent.
- The specification, schemas, and tools are not copied. The guide refers to
  them by their file paths in the source repository.
